## Project-specific

# The stock Visual Studio ignore list contains *.sdf, intended for SQL Server Data Tools
# scratch files. This project's card data IS a pair of SQL Server Compact .sdf databases and
# both are tracked, so *.sdf is deliberately absent above. These two must stay committed:
!Scrolls/BoosterPacks.sdf
!Scrolls/Decks.sdf

# Likewise *.user is ignored above, but this project's .csproj.user is tracked on purpose.
!Scrolls/Scrolls.csproj.user

# Visual Studio 2010 upgrade report. Never commit: it embeds absolute paths from the
# machine the project was upgraded on.
UpgradeLog.XML
UpgradeLog*.XML
_UpgradeReport_Files/

# Vendor installer kept beside the solution
SSCERuntime-ENU.exe
